{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/a9t2z7","slideIndex":4,"text":"Prototype metrics are from CTO_APPLICATION_GUIDE.md and ARCHITECTURE.md. The final synthetic test evaluation reported document mask precision/recall 0.981/0.946, mask mAP50 0.982 and mask mAP50–95 0.959; number-box precision/recall 0.998/1.000, mAP50 0.995 and mAP50–95 0.667. These are synthetic-set results, not estimates of real camera or production performance. The UI score is round(100 × min(document detector confidence, verification confidence)); no safe output maps to zero, while unavailable inputs remain unscored. It is not calibrated. Equitas context is based on its FY2024–25 Integrated Annual Report and public Developer Portal API catalogue. The suggested KYC/loan-pack pilot is a proposal subject to Equitas security, legal and architecture review, and should keep human operators responsible for decisions. Sources: https://ir.equitas.bank.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Equitas-AR-2024-25-1.pdf ; https://developer.equitas.bank.in/ ."}